ipeline management and email integration. Can we schedule something for next Tuesday at 2 PM?</p><p>Best,<br>Bob Martinez<br>CEO, Globex Industries</p>", "text_content": null, "communication_type": "Communication", "status": "Linked", "sent_or_received": "Received", "communication_date": "2026-05-11 14:44:05.126804", "read_receipt": 0, "send_after": null, "sender_full_name": "bob.martinez@example.com", "read_by_recipient": 0, "read_by_recipient_on": null, "reference_doctype": "CRM Lead", "reference_name": "CRM-LEAD-2026-00002", "reference_owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "email_account": null, "in_reply_to": null, "user": "Administrator", "email_template": null, "unread_notification_sent": 0, "seen": 0, "_user_tags": null, "message_id": null, "uid": 0, "imap_folder": null, "email_status": "Open", "has_attachment": 0, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null, "_seen": null}, {"name": "a0kvvu6g27", "creation": "2026-04-10 14:44:05.126804", "modified": "2026-04-10 14:44:05.126804", "modified_by": "sarah.demo@example.com", "owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "subject": "CRM Pricing Proposal — TechStart Inc (15 seats)", "communication_medium": "Email", "sender": "sarah.demo@example.com", "recipients": "david.lee@example.com", "cc": null, "bcc": null, "phone_no": null, "delivery_status": "", "content": "<p>Hi David,</p><p>Great connecting with your team today — really glad the API walkthrough was useful. Attached is our pricing proposal for 15 seats including onboarding and priority support.</p><p>Happy to jump on a call if you have questions.</p><p>Cheers</p>", "text_content": null, "communication_type": "Communication", "status": "Linked", "sent_or_received": "Sent", "communication_date": "2026-04-10 14:44:05.126804", "read_receipt": 0, "send_after": null, "sender_full_name": "Sarah Connor", "read_by_recipient": 0, "read_by_recipient_on": null, "reference_doctype": "CRM Lead", "reference_name": "CRM-LEAD-2026-00004", "reference_own